WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:02.220
(rock music)

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.720
- All right, I wanna share one more story

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.220
that might tug at your heartstrings.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.433
Before we close the show,
this is what I'm liking.

00:00:07.433 --> 00:00:10.350
(rock music)

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.870
Usually on birthdays we're
used to getting presents,

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:13.703
that's the norm.

00:00:13.703 --> 00:00:15.780
But one Iowa pastor is making his birthday

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.010
about giving presents

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:19.650
in the form of free gas to his neighbors.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.450
He just finished his second year

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.400
and has filled tanks
for thousands of people

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.360
in his community.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.650
We have him on the line right now

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.440
along with his friend who's
helping him with the project.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.570
Let's say hi to Reverend Rob and Duana.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:31.454
Hi.

00:00:31.454 --> 00:00:33.501
(audience cheering)

00:00:33.501 --> 00:00:35.280
- Hello, hello

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.120
- Hello.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.230
Well, thank you for joining us

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:39.150
and how did this all come about?

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:41.646
- So first of all, Kelly, thank
you so much for having us.

00:00:41.646 --> 00:00:45.330
One day, I was at a gas
pump a couple years ago,

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:47.970
and a young lady's card declined,

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:50.130
and I just went over and paid for the gas.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:54.000
I went home that night and
I went to sleep, I prayed

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.800
and the next morning when I woke up,

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.930
I felt this unction and I called Duana

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:01.020
and I said, "Hey, I think
we should give away gas."

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:04.680
And that year we gave
away $5,000 worth of gas.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:08.310
And then this year we gave
away $20,000 worth of gas.

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:11.760
And my friend has been
right there the entire time.

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:14.340
- Yeah, it was a pretty cool opportunity

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.890
for our nonprofit Des Moines
Urban Experience to step in.

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.110
We really believe in helping
people in our community

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:20.610
and uplifting their voices.

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:23.670
And when Rob shared with
me the vision that he had,

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:24.510
being his friend,

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:27.150
I wanted to pour into that
vision as much as we could.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:30.600
We decided to team up and
really help our community

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.160
at a time when everyone's hurting.

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:34.020
And this was the perfect opportunity,

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:36.600
because everyone needs gas.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:37.950
- That is so exceptional.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.750
Thank you guys so much.

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.900
Everybody give it up for
Reverend Rob and Duana.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:45.118
I'm liking your post right now, y'all.

00:01:45.118 --> 00:01:46.830
And that's not all.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:48.210
- Thank you so much.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.800
- I know, we're not over yet.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:51.300
The Lord's still present, watch this.

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.700
That's not all, our season
long partner Pilot Pen,

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:56.130
makers of G2, the go-to pen
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:59.400
want to honor truly unstoppable
people just like y'all.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.840
So, they're gonna be writing you a check

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.354
for $1,000 to help fill
even more gas tanks.

00:02:03.354 --> 00:02:06.116
(audience cheering)

00:02:06.116 --> 00:02:07.197
- Thank you so much, Kelly.

00:02:07.197 --> 00:02:10.350
Our goal for next year, you
know, our presenting sponsor

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.290
which is the same gas station
as this year is coming back

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.090
and our goal is $40,000.

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:18.537
And so, we really do lean on our partners

00:02:18.537 --> 00:02:21.570
and our community members
to help us raise this money

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:22.680
to go out and do it.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:23.513
- Yes, thank you.

00:02:23.513 --> 00:02:24.450
- Keep it up, y'all.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:26.010
This is a really beautiful
thing you're doing for people.

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:27.810
It seems so simple, but
it's super effective.

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:30.300
You gotta get to work, so,
gotta take your kids to school.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:31.290
Gotta have transportation.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.230
So thank you so much and
thank you to all our guests

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:36.930
this hour, Niall Horan,
Kimberly Williams-Paisley,

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.928
Mika Pazinski, Tracy and Nancy.

00:02:38.928 --> 00:02:39.886
Y'all have a great day

00:02:39.886 --> 00:02:41.421
and if it's not, well, try and change it.

